Z||000000||GT Bastard||04-28-2001||10:23 AM||||I'm off to Thunder Valley 1/4 mile track in Marion, SD.  I'm pretty psyched... Brad and his sister are bringing their Fiero's and my F-Body friend is going to do some digital footage.  I tossed out my passenger seat and ditched my spare tire.  It'll be interesting...  May the Fierogods be with me!<P><BR>-The Bastard<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gtbastard.gif">     <P>"My heroes are John Wayne, the Simpsons, and whoever canceled Full House/Bob Saget."||||reg||14
